the knowledge base computed_fields_example includes:

the text of the source program is at "sources/computed-fields-example.l4".

the age of an employee is a number N if
    the current year of the employee is a number M
    and the date of birth of the employee is a number K
    and N = M - K.

the years of service of an employee is a number N if
    the current year of the employee is a number M
    and the date of employment of the employee is a number K
    and N = M - K.

an employee has senior if
    the years of service of the employee >= 10.

an employee has eligible if
    the employee has senior
    and the monthly salary of the employee <= 6000.

the interest of an account is a number if
    the apply the balance of the account for the rate of the account is the number.

the projected of an account is a number N if
    the balance of the account is a number M
    and the interest of the account is a number K
    and N = M + K.

the area of a shape is a number N if
    the width of the shape is a number M
    and the height of the shape is a number K
    and N = M * K.

